    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Wide, one continuous camera move, no cut: all three people are ALREADY in the room at the very first frame and all three are visible at once — there is NO entrance, nobody walks in, the door stays shut. 钱经理 (S3) strides the two paces from the far side of the door to the far side of the desk, his charcoal waistcoat swinging and nothing pinned to his chest, and comes to a stop. 苏小满 (S1) does not move at all. 小唐 (S4) does not move at all, she stays against the LEFT corner wall with only her eyes moving. The three of them are the only people in frame.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) at the far side plants both feet wide, leans forward on straight arms and slams his open palm flat onto the desktop; the palm lands flat against the bare desk. 苏小满 (S1) holds her ground on the near side, still unmoved. 小唐 (S4) is still in the LEFT corner, unmoved. Three people, no more.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, closer on 钱经理's (S3) flushed face as he announces it in a loud nasal Mandarin, filing each item like a charge sheet: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.400, reverse over the desk onto 苏小满 (S1) on the near side, the blind-light barring the wall behind her: she stands perfectly still, both hands loose at her sides, chin level, eyes on him. Her mouth stays closed and she says nothing. 小唐 (S4) is still a small figure in the LEFT corner. The room is empty apart from these three."
