    "summary": "Pressed from the wall, the young colleague gives a deliberately vague testimony, and the manager takes it as proof.",
    "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) stands behind the desk facing the camera, the grey filing cabinets directly behind his back, one palm flat on the desk top; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of that desk with her back to the camera, facing him; 小唐 (S4) stands flattened against the back wall at the far left of frame, her shoulder blade pressed to the white paint and her hands folded low in front of her. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the manager stays behind the desk, the cleaner stays at the near end of it with her back turned, and the young colleague stays low against the left-hand wall, watching from where she stands. The closed wooden door in the back wall stays shut, its surface plain wood, and a band of blind-light runs across the white wall behind her.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) turns his shoulder toward the door and jerks his chin at 小唐 (S4), summoning her forward with that gesture alone.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, closer on 小唐 (S4): she peels off the wall, folds her hands together, keeps her eyes on the floor tiles and lets them flick once toward 苏小满 (S1), then away; she speaks in a small thin nervous Mandarin, fast and slightly breathy: [Chinese] 钱经理。中午，我看见她往兜里塞东西。没看清。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.400, reverse onto 苏小满 (S1) across the desk: her shoulders stay level, only her eyes travel to the girl by the door.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.400, close on 钱经理 (S3) taking that in, the corner of his mouth pulling up, his lips closed for the rest of the shot.",
    "soundscape": "A thin nervous voice close to the lens, the fluorescent panels buzzing, a chair creaking somewhere behind the door, one dry swallow.",
    "music": "N/A",
    "crowd": false,
    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) turns his shoulder toward the door and jerks his chin at 小唐 (S4), summoning her forward with that gesture alone.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, closer on 小唐 (S4): she peels off the wall, folds her hands together, keeps her eyes on the floor tiles and lets them flick once toward 苏小满 (S1), then away; she speaks in a small thin nervous Mandarin, fast and slightly breathy: [Chinese] 钱经理。中午，我看见她往兜里塞东西。没看清。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.400, reverse onto 苏小满 (S1) across the desk: her shoulders stay level, only her eyes travel to the girl by the door.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.400, close on 钱经理 (S3) taking that in, the corner of his mouth pulling up, his lips closed for the rest of the shot.",
    "lean_anchor": "The whole clip takes place in one small private office and the camera never leaves it. The room has four plain white walls, a grey metal filing cabinet along the far wall, a long wooden desk standing across the middle of the floor, and venetian blinds on the right-hand wall laying bright bands of light across the desk top and the floor. A closed wooden door is set flat into the back wall, its surface plain wood with a small silver handle. Everything in this room reads as an office interior: the desk, the cabinet, the blinds and the plain painted walls."
