    "summary": "The cleaner turns the accusation back on the witness; the girl retreats into her own certainty.",
    "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of the desk with her back to the camera, facing the back wall; 小唐 (S4) has taken one step in from the wall and now stands against the left-hand wall at the far left of frame, her palm flat on the white paint; 钱经理 (S3) stands behind the desk on the far side, the grey filing cabinets behind him, facing the lens with his arms folded. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the two women stand one behind the other along the depth of the room, the colleague nearer the back wall and the cleaner nearer the desk, and the manager stays behind the desk watching them. The closed wooden door in the back wall stays shut, its surface plain wood, and a band of blind-light lies across the floor.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) turns her head and shoulders toward the door, fixing 小唐 (S4) with an even, unhurried look, and says it quietly in low steady Mandarin, without raising her voice at all: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, close on 小唐 (S4): she shrinks her neck down into her collar, plants one hand on the doorframe behind her, looks anywhere but at the cleaner, and answers in a thin defensive Mandarin: [Chinese] 反正，我看见了。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.600, wide: 小唐 (S4) stands against the left-hand wall in the near part of the room, 苏小满 (S1) stands at the desk just behind her, and 钱经理 (S3) stands motionless behind the desk with the filing cabinets behind him, watching them like a spectator, arms folded.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.600, hold. All three of them stay exactly where they are, every mouth closed, the office still.",
    "soundscape": "Two quiet voices in a hard-surfaced room, a chair leg scraping, the wall clock ticking, a muffled hum of room tone.",
    "music": "N/A",
    "crowd": false,
    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) turns her head and shoulders toward the door, fixing 小唐 (S4) with an even, unhurried look, and says it quietly in low steady Mandarin, without raising her voice at all: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, close on 小唐 (S4): she shrinks her neck down into her collar, plants one hand on the doorframe behind her, looks anywhere but at the cleaner, and answers in a thin defensive Mandarin: [Chinese] 反正，我看见了。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.600, wide: 小唐 (S4) stands against the left-hand wall in the near part of the room, 苏小满 (S1) stands at the desk just behind her, and 钱经理 (S3) stands motionless behind the desk with the filing cabinets behind him, watching them like a spectator, arms folded.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.600, hold. All three of them stay exactly where they are, every mouth closed, the office still.",
    "lean_anchor": "The whole clip takes place in one small private office and the camera never leaves it. The room has four plain white walls, a grey metal filing cabinet along the far wall, a long wooden desk standing across the middle of the floor, and venetian blinds on the right-hand wall laying bright bands of light across the desk top and the floor. A closed wooden door is set flat into the back wall, its surface plain wood with a small silver handle. Everything in this room reads as an office interior: the desk, the cabinet, the blinds and the plain painted walls."
