    "summary": "He orders her to empty her pockets, offering the alternative of security; she holds her ground and refuses to be searched.",
    "shots": "Entry state, re-anchored to the reference image: 钱经理 (S3) is stepping round the end of the desk onto the near side and closing to one pace in front of 苏小满 (S1); 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of the desk with her back to the camera, facing him across one pace of bare floor. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the manager stands in front of the cleaner, one pace away, and they hold the shot together — the desk behind them, the grey filing cabinets to one side, the closed wooden door in the back wall behind the camera. The closed wooden door in the back wall stays shut and its surface is plain wood.\n[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) filling the frame on her own, the plain office wall and the bright window band behind her, one person in this shot: she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut, her own hand and the cloth filling the whole frame. She is silent after that.",
